  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        40,
        40
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Read me first",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Single control video\n\nThe smallest useful H3 Fun-ControlNet graph: a **prompt**, an optional **first\nframe**, and one **control video** that the generation follows frame by frame.\n\n**Set these before running**\n\n1. `Load Video` -> your control pass (depth, canny, pose, HED or MLSD).\n   It must be the **same width, height and frame count** as the generation.\n   The node raises with both numbers if they disagree.\n2. `Load Image` -> a first frame, or delete it and the prompt does the work.\n3. Prompt, width, height, length on the H3 node. Length snaps to H3's\n   **17n + 5** grid at 24fps: 5, 22, 39, 56, 73, 90, 107 ...\n\n**The ControlNet checkpoint must be curve-form.** The original full-width\nrelease will not load and says so. See the README.\n\n**strength 1.0 is the right starting point.** Higher does not improve\nadherence, it saturates: washed out, subject smeared."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        40,
        370
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        250
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "The schedule window",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## start_percent / end_percent\n\nControl applies over this slice of the sampling schedule. The default 0.0 to\n1.0 means it is asserted at every step, **including the last ones where texture\nforms**.\n\nIf your control pass has featureless regions (a smooth ground plane, an empty\nsky) the ControlNet keeps insisting those surfaces are smooth and suppresses\nwhatever texture the prompt asks for.\n\nEnding around **0.6** pins the structure while the noise is still coarse and\nfrees the late steps to put in detail the control cannot describe."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
